ith a default value:\r\n```psql (10.4)\r\nType \"help\" for help.\r\n\r\npostgres=# create table t1(k text default 'default for t1', v int);\r\nCREATE TABLE\r\npostgres=# create table t2(k text default 'default for t2', v int);\r\nCREATE TABLE\r\npostgres=# insert into t1(v) values (1);\r\nINSERT 0 1\r\npostgres=# insert into t2(v) values (1);\r\nINSERT 0 1\r\npostgres=# select * from t1;\r\n       k        | v \r\n----------------+---\r\n default for t1 | 1\r\n(1 row)\r\n\r\npostgres=# select * from t2;\r\n       k        | v \r\n----------------+---\r\n default for t2 | 1\r\n(1 row)\r\n```\r\nStart a new session:\r\n```\r\npsql (10.4)\r\nType \"help\" for help.\r\n\r\npostgres=# insert into t1(v) values (1);\r\nserver closed the connection unexpectedly\r\n\tThis probably means the server terminated abnormally\r\n\tbefore or while processing the request.\r\nThe connection to the server was lost. Attempting reset: Failed.\r\n!> \r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/461490426/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"hectorgcr","id":20052555,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDUyNTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20052555?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr","html_url":"https://github.com/hectorgcr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/repos","events_url":"ht